{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"CHANGELOG.md","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","created_at":"2026-10-13T14:01:07.782780Z","id":"579bcbdc3b3c74b8ec8df8d9ab28bfc4771e73fcd88dd27222f34074231056cd","body":{"detail":"origin/main crates/toolpath-convo/src/derive.rs lines 339-421 already turn view.events into conversation.event steps, with a comment explaining it is there so a Claude session keeps its attachments. What changes in this diff is where those steps go (interleaved, not appended) and how they link, not whether they exist. The changelog lists newest first, so an entry dated before the one under it reads as out of order.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":5},"end":{"line":17},"content_hash":"f0a4fbd86f7219f3af03f824366fc6c304588975ad666f8df3793c7f3801d2bc"},"suggested_fix":"Change the sentence to say derive_path now emits conversation.event steps at their item position instead of after all turns. Date the entry on or after 2026-09-29, or drop the date and keep the version numbers.","summary":"The toolpath-convo changelog entry says derive_path previously dropped conversation.event steps, but origin/main already emitted them; and the entry's date, 2026-09-21, is earlier than the path-cli 0.29.0 entry below it, 2026-09-29","tags":["review","review:pr-144-qual-3"]}}
